included and stays open.

The six sub-answers under item 1 are MY defaults, not the operator's, and the
entry says so explicitly: WARN ships first, cutover forward-only with no
backfill-stamping, pinned-length test yes, the CLAUDE.md table drafted and never
applied, a declared scope over the sealed adversarial_verify.py, and the duplicate
substrate tuple entry reported rather than removed. Recording an assumption as an
