adversarial_verify.py or the capstone lint, and two agents on one file is the
collision that cost work three times today. Item 5 is disjoint and runs parallel.

One brief carries second-hand evidence and says so -- the eval-run lint defect is
the census agent's report, not my reproduction, and the tooling agent is told to
reproduce it first and stop if it does not hold.

